		{"id":"n000000000000000f","type":"text","text":"*evaluation/diagnostics.py* — kind 分级\n\n| kind | 例子 | 可释放给模型 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `compiler` | `kernel.cpp:17:9: error: ...` + 源码行 + note | ✅ 中档 |\n| `synthesis` | `ERROR: [SYNCHK …]`、`ERROR: [HLS 214-…]` | ✅ 中档 |\n| `functional` | `Mismatch ... expected/got`、`Test Failed` | 新 functional_diagnostics 释放结构化事实；public 释放尾部 |\n| `environment`/`license`/`timeout` | signal pipe、license、超时 | ❌ 不进模型 |","x":-730,"y":490,"width":760,"height":350,"color":"3"},
