		{"id":"n0000000000000010","type":"text","text":"*evaluation/validator.py* — feedback_policy 三档\n\n| 值 | 释放给模型的文本 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `category_only`（默认） | `csim: compile_error. Detailed diagnostics are not released by this task.` |\n| `compiler_diagnostics`（新增） | `compiler` + `synthesis` 条目的结构化文本（`compiler_text`） |\n| `public_diagnostics` | 原始 `diagnostic_tail`（全部） |","x":-1580,"y":360,"width":720,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n0000000000000011","type":"text","text":"**csim.log 结构** (举例)\n\n|区段|行|内容|\n|---|---|---|\n|头部/搭工程|1–29|vitis-run 横幅、`open_project`/`set_top`/`add_files`/`open_solution`/`set_part`/`create_clock`，全是 INFO/WARNING|\n|**真正诊断**|30–108|clang 编译，含错误块|\n|收尾|109–120|`ERROR: [SIM 211-100]` 汇总、CSIM Failed、Tcl 栈、INFO 计时|\n\n真正有价值的是第 2 段。单个错误（`kernel.cpp:17:9`）的完整 clang 块长这样：\n\n```\n../../../../input/kernel.cpp:17:9: error: no matching function for call to object of type 'ap_uint<3>'\n        ena(0) = ena0;\n        ^~~\nD:/FPGA/AMDDesignTools/2025.2/Vitis/include\\etc\\ap_int_base.h:1098:51: note: candidate function not viable: requires 2 arguments, but 1 was provided\n  AP_INLINE AP_NODEBUG ap_range_ref<_AP_W, _AP_S> operator()(int Hi, int Lo) {\n        ^\nD:/FPGA/AMDDesignTools/2025.2/Vitis/include\\etc\\ap_int_base.h:1102:51: note: candidate function not viable: requires 2 arguments, but 1 was provided\n  AP_INLINE AP_NODEBUG ap_range_ref<_AP_W, _AP_S> operator()(int Hi, int Lo) const {\n        ^\nD:/FPGA/AMDDesignTools/2025.2/Vitis/include\\etc\\ap_int_base.h:1107:51: note: candidate function template not viable: requires 2 arguments, but 1 was provided\n  AP_INLINE AP_NODEBUG ap_range_ref<_AP_W, _AP_S> operator()(\n        ^\nD:/FPGA/AMDDesignTools/2025.2/Vitis/include\\etc\\ap_int_base.h:1116:51: note: candidate function template not viable: requires 2 arguments, but 1 was provided\n  AP_INLINE AP_NODEBUG ap_range_ref<_AP_W, _AP_S> operator()(\n        ^\n```\n\n同样结构重复三次（17:9 / 18:9 / 19:9，对应 `ena(0)/ena(1)/ena(2)`），然后收尾：\n\n```\n1 warning and 3 errors generated.\nmingw32-make: *** [csim.mk:97: obj/kernel.o] Error 1\n```","x":1000,"y":-250,"width":980,"height":1013,"color":"3"}
